	<string name="hwp.pets.skill.family.desc">Wyrm, wisp, living flame: fire breath on hazards. Raven: spots chests. Scarab: bonus gold per pickup. Imp: fire bolt on stunned enemies. Cat: stronger Mend. Dog: stronger Morale. Squire: more Fetch. Candle: sometimes finds secret entrances (3/6/10% each).</string>
